<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>{{.Subject}}</title>
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; supported-color-schemes: light dark; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .bg-outer { background-color: #0E0F14 !important; }
  .bg-card { background-color: #1A1B22 !important; border-color: #2C2E3A !important; }
  .t-main { color: #F2F2F7 !important; }
  .t-sub { color: #A8A8B3 !important; }
  .t-brand { color: #8E9BFF !important; }
  .bg-code { background-color: #272B5C !important; }
  .t-code { color: #C9D0FF !important; }
  .bd-line { border-color: #2C2E3A !important; }
  .t-foot { color: #7C7C86 !important; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-outer" style="margin:0;word-break:keep-all;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#F4F5FB;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">인증번호 {{.Code}} · 10분 안에 입력해 주세요</div>
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;&#8204;&nbsp;</div>
<table role="presentation" class="bg-outer" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;background-color:#F4F5FB;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:480px;">
<tr>
<td align="left" class="t-brand" style="padding:0 8px 20px 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px;color:#0113A3;">smap</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="bg-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E5E7F0;border-radius:16px;padding:32px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;">
<tr>
<td class="t-main" style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;font-weight:700;color:#1C1C1E;word-break:keep-all;">{{.Title}}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="t-sub" style="padding-top:12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#6B6B73;word-break:keep-all;">{{.Description}}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding-top:24px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;">
<tr>
<td class="bg-code t-code" align="center" bgcolor="#EEF0FB" style="background-color:#EEF0FB;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:34px;line-height:40px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:8px;text-indent:8px;color:#0113A3;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;">{{.Code}}</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="t-sub" align="center" style="padding-top:12px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#6B6B73;">10분 동안 유효해요</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="bd-line" style="padding-top:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7F0;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="t-sub" style="padding-top:24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6B6B73;word-break:keep-all;">인증번호는 누구에게도 알려 주지 마세요. SMAP은 전화나 메시지로 인증번호를 묻지 않아요.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="t-sub" style="padding-top:8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6B6B73;word-break:keep-all;">직접 요청하지 않았다면 이 메일을 무시해 주세요. 계정에는 아무 변화도 생기지 않아요.</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" class="t-foot" style="padding-top:24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#9A9AA3;">SMAP · 소중한 사람들과 함께하는 위치 공유<br>이 메일은 발신 전용이에요.</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
